DESCRIPTION:Join the African American Cultural Center as it celebrates Hara
 mbee! and 55 years of the African American Cultural Center and its legacy 
 of fostering community\, connection and student success at NC State.\n\nHa
 rambee! is designed to connect the Wolfpack community with a wide array of
  resources and services available on and off campus. By strengthening rela
 tionships across the university and beyond\, the program promotes academic
  achievement and personal growth.\n\nTogether\, we will celebrate our shar
 ed commitment to excellence\, belonging and community.
GEO:35.785221;-78.675064
LOCATION:Harris Field
SUMMARY:Harambee!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/harambee-9582
